<view class="home-page">
  <view class="header">
    <text class="hello">你好，{{displayName || "作者"}}</text>
    <text class="subtitle">余主任留声机</text>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>

  <view class="project-panel">
    <text class="panel-label">当前回忆录</text>
    <text class="project-title">{{projectTitle || "正在加载回忆录"}}</text>
    <text class="project-meta">从这里开始语音访谈，转写记录和项目设置可在底部入口查看。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="voice-panel">
    <image class="voice-icon" src="/assets/memoir-microphone.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    <text class="voice-title">开始语音聊天</text>
    <text class="voice-copy">一边说话，一边实时显示文字；结束后保存原始语音和校正文。</text>
    <button class="primary-button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="startVoiceChat">
      {{loading ? "加载中" : "进入语音"}}
    </button>
  </view>
</view>
